{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21708","headline":"内状诗寄杨白二员外 · 元稹","name":"内状诗寄杨白二员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天门暗辟玉琤鍧，昼送中枢晓禁清。\n彤管内人书细腻，金匳御印篆分明。\n冲街不避将军令，跋勅兼题宰相名。\n南省郎官谁待诏，与君将向世间行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}